Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.91,0:00:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,YUM!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.93,0:01:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you splackers, rise and shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.89,0:01:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All you guys do is eat and sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.09,0:01:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your point is?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.99,0:01:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me, what's for breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.45,0:01:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I rest my case.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.99,0:01:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, wake me up when\Nit's chow time, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.41,0:01:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.89,0:01:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.51,0:01:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.42,0:01:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.19,0:01:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate when he does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.81,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, some peace\Nand quiet for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.17,0:02:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We needed this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.69,0:02:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, after everything we've been\Nthrough, it feels nice just to kick back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.55,0:02:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.39,0:02:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, Yugi, there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems every time we restore peace to the\Nworld, a greater evil is waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.27,0:02:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you've got a point there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.69,0:02:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look on the bright\Nside. Every battle that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.77,0:02:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,we fight together also\Nbrings us one step closer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.51,0:02:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,to finding out the secrets\Nof your past the three
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.95,0:02:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,egyptian god cards yep\Nthey're back in our deck
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.67,0:02:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,again which means it's\Ntime to pick up where you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.61,0:02:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and i left off as soon\Nas we get back home we're
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.67,0:02:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,going straight to that\Nhistory museum and these
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.03,0:02:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,three cards are going\Nto give us some Answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.29,0:02:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:02:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.93,0:02:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I was even more worried\Nabout you than Taya was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.63,0:03:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.95,0:03:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we get up now, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.49,0:03:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.81,0:03:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you two lovebirds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.73,0:03:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's waiting. Let's go. Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.21,0:03:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But I get to hold a pantea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.21,0:03:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Hawkins, for an old stuffed\Nshirt, you make a mean dish of pasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.63,0:03:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lot more where that came\Nfrom if you kids want to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.87,0:03:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Professor, but we\Nshould all be getting back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.33,0:03:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you leave when we haven't\Neven gone out on one single date yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.93,0:03:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Beck is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not about the date part.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.73,0:03:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What I mean is it's too\Nsoon for you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.47,0:03:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, ditto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.69,0:03:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We should stay and relax for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.45,0:03:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, if every meal is like this, I'm\Nmoving in with the professor for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.21,0:03:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do you think, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.67,0:03:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It is kind of nice here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.05,0:04:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of nice? It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.91,0:04:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me for a moment, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.39,0:04:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.65,0:04:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.77,0:04:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me one good reason why we should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.73,0:04:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.69,0:04:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, wait, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to get back to\Nhelp the Pharaoh, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.13,0:04:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.41,0:04:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you guys have\Nimportant stuff to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.49,0:04:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I've waited 5,000 years\Nto find out about my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.51,0:04:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't think another\Nday or two is going to hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.63,0:04:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean we should stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.47,0:04:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,On second thought, guys,\Nlet's stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.89,0:04:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.80,0:04:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I call dibs on the lounge chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.59,0:04:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I get the hammock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.71,0:05:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I not surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.69,0:05:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you guys get tired of being tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.79,0:05:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we need a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this romantic, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.95,0:05:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.25,0:05:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.19,0:05:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough vacationing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.01,0:05:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,When is your flight home, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.53,0:05:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone did make plans, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.31,0:05:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.87,0:05:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus flew us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.53,0:05:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't afford a return flight. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.91,0:05:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.37,0:05:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And you didn't think\Nabout this before today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, it didn't occur\Nto you either. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.85,0:05:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to plan ahead, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, now we're all stranded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.69,0:05:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just peachy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.93,0:05:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we'll get some\Nquality time together after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.67,0:05:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't count on that short stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.79,0:05:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Kaiba's chopper.\NBut what's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.91,0:05:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you guys could use a lift Nah,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.81,0:06:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's tons\Nof taxis out here in the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,middle of nowhere Wanna\Nfly in style with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.27,0:06:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.43,0:06:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I call dibs on an aisle seat
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.47,0:06:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course there is one catch In\Nexchange for the door-to-door
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.41,0:06:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,service You'll have to enter my\Nbrother's new dueling tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.41,0:06:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,New tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.83,0:06:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let me fill\Nin a few of the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.59,0:06:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you guys heard\Nabout our new theme park?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.41,0:06:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Who hasn't heard about Kaiba Land?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.51,0:06:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only been in every newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.67,0:06:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you know it's about to open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.59,0:06:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And my brother wants to\Nkick things off with a bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.31,0:06:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that lunatic darts\Nand the stunt he pulled,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.31,0:06:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Our company's reputation is shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.79,0:06:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's up to you\Nto fix it. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Seto, I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's plan a big event to celebrate\NKaivaland's grand opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.41,0:07:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, something that will grab the attention\Nof every news station in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.25,0:07:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think I know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.09,0:07:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The ultimate tournament. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.89,0:07:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll gather the greatest\Nduelists from around the world and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.05,0:07:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,let them duke it out for a\Nshot at the championship title.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.07,0:07:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be the biggest\Nthing since Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.65,0:07:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.71,0:07:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Roland, update these\Ntournament contracts. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.99,0:07:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.90,0:07:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you don't mind my asking, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.01,0:07:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, sir, what are you planning\Nto call this new tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.25,0:07:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Call it the Kaiba Corp Grand Championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.19,0:07:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,An excellent choice, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.19,0:07:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get the show on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.11,0:07:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.45,0:07:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire up the chopper, Roland.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.95,0:07:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to track down the\Nbest duelists in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.19,0:07:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto's expecting to see you\Nright away, so let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.49,0:07:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.21,0:07:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You might want to try asking us first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.85,0:07:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother may think he's got\Nthe whole world on a string,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.81,0:07:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's not the boss of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.15,0:08:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, since we can't get home\Nwithout him, he does have the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.27,0:08:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.18,0:08:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but you'd think Kaiba would have the\Ndecency to come here and ask us for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.10,0:08:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's really\Nbusy right now. In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,he's so wrapped up in his\Njob these days that he
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.47,0:08:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,won't even be participating\Nin his own tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.57,0:08:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.48,0:08:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So rich boy's not gonna duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.35,0:08:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That really doesn't seem like Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother's afraid of getting his\Nbutt kicked in public again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.55,0:08:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,One more humiliating defeat and\Nhis reputation will really be shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.03,0:08:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.51,0:08:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He has too much to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try opening up a\Nchain of amusement parks someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.65,0:08:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me, it wasn't an easy\Ndecision for my brother to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.61,0:08:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.43,0:08:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to shoot off your big mouth. Who? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.57,0:08:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe I did get a bit\Ncarried away back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.89,0:08:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:09:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get down to business and talk\Nabout this tournament, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.49,0:09:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We're inviting the top-ranked duelists\Nfrom every corner of the globe To battle
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.93,0:09:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,each other for a shot at\Nthe world championship
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.25,0:09:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,title But in order for us to do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.53,0:09:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,we need the world champ
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.35,0:09:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.95,0:09:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.67,0:09:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, the best duelists in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.03,0:09:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I say no?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.95,0:09:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, you can count\Nme in. That is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.27,0:09:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd join If you get\NYugi, you're getting me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.49,0:09:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.25,0:09:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the youngest regional\Nchampion to play the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.45,0:09:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, anywhere Yugi goes, I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.23,0:09:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It just so happens I was told\Nto invite all three of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.75,0:09:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So I have a ticket here for\NYugi, Rebecca, and Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,As we say in the biz, it's time to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.45,0:09:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The next flight to\NKaivaland is boarding now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.03,0:10:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So, my dear friend Herr Kaiba is\Nthrowing another tournament, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.99,0:10:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.65,0:10:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, like I always say,\Nevery rose has its thorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.79,0:10:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.95,0:10:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd better be careful,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.03,0:10:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,for even the most delicate\Nflower can be quite dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.95,0:10:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't want you to hurt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Auf Wiedersehen, Herr Khyber.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.49,0:10:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gents, welcome to Khyberland.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.85,0:10:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.53,0:10:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, you're fogging up the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.29,0:10:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We plan to open tons of\Nthese all around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.21,0:10:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they've got\Nevery ride ever invented.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.89,0:10:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.87,0:11:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope they've got a\Ntunnel of love, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.21,0:11:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we get the full tour, I\Ngotta use the little boy's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.45,0:11:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,First door on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.53,0:11:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be a statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.95,0:11:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to cross the blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.49,0:11:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you said the park\Ndidn't open yet. It didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.07,0:11:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,These are special guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and did I mention every\Nride is free today? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.31,0:11:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I love this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.67,0:11:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's tilt and whirl till we hurl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.57,0:11:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.59,0:11:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I need some female friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.97,0:11:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved the best part for last.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We call that the Kaiba Dome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.65,0:11:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a Blue Eyes arena?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.01,0:11:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not dealing with normal people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.29,0:11:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.21,0:12:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the world's largest indoor stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's the KC Dual Tech 760.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too shabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our new state-of-the-art\NDual Monsters platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, rip that blade knife to shreds now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.75,0:12:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,In your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.19,0:12:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Revealing Magic Card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.19,0:12:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Scapegoat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.13,0:12:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.27,0:12:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That move makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why activate Scapegoat now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.11,0:12:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like your state-of-the-art\Ncomputer just made a rookie mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.09,0:12:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.67,0:12:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling that Face\NDown card's a trap, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.83,0:12:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.47,0:12:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Revealing Trap Card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.85,0:12:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate DNA Surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.27,0:12:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as the card remains in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.17,0:12:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,every monster on the playing field will\Nbe transformed into a dragon. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now activating the magic\Ncard polymerization.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.59,0:13:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That computer did have a plan, told ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.53,0:13:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now fusing together all\Ncreatures on my side of the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.87,0:13:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,playing field in order to form\Nfive-headed dragon monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.49,0:13:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he'll beat\Nthat digital duelist now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.39,0:13:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.30,0:13:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.45,0:13:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Our computer was programmed to mimic the\Nstrategies of the world's best duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We've imported Seto's\Ndeck and Yugi's, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.41,0:13:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's got mine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.23,0:13:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so it can lose,\Ntoo, just to be fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But what fun is it to duel against\Na computer that always wins?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.37,0:13:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.13,0:13:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So we let players choose one of five\Nlevels, from beginner all the way to expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.43,0:14:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What an awesome way for kids to practice\Ndueling and improve their skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.95,0:14:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, a few more duels like this, and I\Nthink Luke there could be a world champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.03,0:14:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Commencing attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.23,0:14:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.33,0:14:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you owe me a blue-eyes burger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.25,0:14:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You put up a good fight, Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.29,0:14:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You just set your level a little too high.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.85,0:14:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't that Yugi Moto over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.21,0:14:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably just one of\Nthose theme park look-alikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.31,0:14:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'M GETTING AN AUTOGRAPH!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.19,0:14:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like someone's a celebrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.95,0:14:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.03,0:14:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.61,0:14:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been a fan of yours\Nsince Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.57,0:14:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.31,0:14:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Leon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.23,0:14:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, anyone want my autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.57,0:14:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we supposed to know you or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.99,0:14:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.41,0:15:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Jumpin' Joey Wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.57,0:15:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle City finalist?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Joe, who?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.13,0:15:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I tell you, I get no respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.49,0:15:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Mr. King of Games?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.83,0:15:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here, sir. Uh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.07,0:15:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you take a look at my deck, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.33,0:15:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what I do, I\Ncan't seem to win a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.01,0:15:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I see the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.21,0:15:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All you got are dragon cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.41,0:15:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, dragons are my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.33,0:15:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I traded all my magic and\Ntrap cards to get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure dragons are powerful, but you'll\Nnever win with this deck Huh? Why not? Uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.61,0:15:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That came out wrong. Here's the deal.\NIt's obvious that you value your cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and that respect is going\Nto take you far But you also
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,need to balance your deck with\Nmagic and trap cards I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.51,0:15:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. Matter of fact,\Ntake this card. You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.63,0:15:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.27,0:16:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart of the underdog It\Nreminds me of a good friend of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.59,0:16:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,mine And it could be just\Nwhat you need Can I keep it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No way Awesome Who does that\Ncard remind you of anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.09,0:16:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.67,0:16:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to test it out now Good luck
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't set the level too high\NIf I were you Thanks, good call
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.69,0:16:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try level two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.39,0:16:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like my plans in full bloom\Nare the sweet smell of revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.07,0:16:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Initiating gameplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.81,0:16:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Commencing duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.01,0:16:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like the Kuiper boys\Nforgot to pay their electric bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.75,0:16:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Either that or there's still\Nsome kinks in your system.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.65,0:16:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.33,0:16:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We worked out every possible bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.09,0:17:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, apparently you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.11,0:17:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,One bug must have somehow\Nslipped through the cracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.85,0:17:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.29,0:17:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll figure this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.97,0:17:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.23,0:17:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.47,0:17:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now altering original dual sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.75,0:17:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not responding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.51,0:17:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost control!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.11,0:17:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.95,0:17:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I suspected. What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.01,0:17:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,According to this analysis,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,your computerized card shark is\Nbeing controlled by an outside party.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.65,0:17:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're not dealing\Nwith any ordinary hacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.27,0:17:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a high-end job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.97,0:17:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.67,0:17:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.11,0:17:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just an amusement park attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.19,0:17:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would someone want to break into it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.17,0:17:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my guess is that they're using\Nit to get something they want from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.15,0:17:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes them think it's gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.53,0:18:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They got your attention, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.77,0:18:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we tear that scrap heap to shreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.51,0:18:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with you, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.29,0:18:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do that, we may\Nnever get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.59,0:18:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.77,0:18:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to get out of here is\Nto defeat that computer in a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So what you're saying is our fate is\Nin the hands of that kid up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.75,0:18:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel. Oh, no! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.93,0:18:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.79,0:18:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now summoning berserk\Ngorilla to the playing field.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.53,0:18:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack points 2,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.99,0:18:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Supplementing monster with one\Nface-down card and concluding turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.59,0:18:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That Jim's gonna crush him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.37,0:18:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs help. Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.41,0:18:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,More bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.85,0:18:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The computer set itself\Nto the toughest level.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.55,0:18:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I'm toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.95,0:18:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.41,0:18:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll never survive level five.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.83,0:18:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just a beginner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.51,0:18:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And if Junior loses the\Nduel to that rust bucket,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.19,0:19:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,we're going to be trapped in this\Nplace for who knows how long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.57,0:19:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you know what we have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.65,0:19:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.83,0:19:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.81,0:19:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.87,0:19:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.35,0:19:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.53,0:19:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cool Very well, I will bring your\Ndeck to victory But you need to have faith
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.19,0:19:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.01,0:19:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's dismantle this thing.\NGo, Yugi. We're all behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.12,0:19:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,let's duel I don't know who's behind this\NBut whoever it is, they must be stopped
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.21,0:19:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move Or forfeit the duel
